{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1000_p", "source_sha256": "60f278730964e31ca7e7e584f170907a983b035d67e95963aefdf410d6774cc3", "ja": "（のり子に新衣装の試着をしてもらった。気に入って\nくれたのか、鏡を見ながら何度も頷いている……）", "zh": "（让福田典子试穿了新服装。看来她很喜欢，一边照着镜子一边不停地点头……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "1299f76b98178d97dc0055014864fa90156b2a084bc3c02c4fb4cffda9985ba5", "ja": "うん……うん！　{$P$}。\n今回の衣装も、すっごくカワイイよ～！", "zh": "嗯……嗯！{$P$}。\n这次的服装也超级可爱哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "b5216f515bacf7c78ecbe74a0893b83eedaf93dccb54f14f00befeaa2469ddfc", "ja": "まあ、やっぱり緊張はしちゃうんだけど……\nでも！　今のアタシは一味違うよ！", "zh": "哎，虽然还是难免会紧张啦……\n不过！现在的我可跟平时不一样哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1003_p", "source_sha256": "cb1c6fbbd8113deef18e3c1e4c721dfad60e6db233363a0153429efe3f4ed1a4", "ja": "おお～。自信いっぱい、って感じが\n立ち姿からも伝わってくるよ。", "zh": "哦～，从站姿也能感受到你那满满的自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "3818dbb6578e1650b1d0e517461709dace35fc8bc89e21fff36f3f932d96de08", "ja": "へへっ、でしょ♪\nアイドルとして、一応、成長はしてるんだよ？", "zh": "嘿嘿，是吧♪\n作为偶像，我姑且也算是在成长嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "d6825acf241cff751235da80ff571b2bdf2725dc938846feb792e850ad6821df", "ja": "今のアタシなら、{$P$}に\n何回カワイイって言われても、全然平気！", "zh": "现在的我，就算被{$P$}说多少次“可爱”，也完全没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a977ec955b04c01f186b06233c2282ac7f98b2661be0090b81cc34309e9cce1a", "ja": "へえ……。\nそういえば、まだ感想を伝えてなかったよな。", "zh": "哦……这么说来，我还没告诉你我的感想呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f1a9b453122266b3d858bfc182b2458af5e13a5e40bcb33d7567c0c90b219800", "ja": "改めて……コホン！\nのり子によく似合ってるよ。すごく綺麗だ。", "zh": "重新说一次……咳咳！\n很适合你，真的很漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "dfd4c991fb0d80a8e516b8d6874a1a869608bcd03cace631436411eb6f12b7e3", "ja": "きっ！？　……んんっ！　まあ、衣装が映えるように\n細かいとこまで気をつけてるからね！", "zh": "唧！？……嗯嗯！毕竟我一直都很注意细节，好让服装更显眼嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b37c14ee26542b6d06e6ac4723efcc1815aab17412b8d8225bd1c9bb1c318844", "ja": "なるほどな。普段から姿勢がいいとは思ってたけど、\n衣装と相まって、一段と洗練されてるな！", "zh": "原来如此。我平时就觉得你姿态很好，和这身服装相得益彰，显得更加干练了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "bc7ae97a485c9c42e62f77e09b3cae9c6bfd211efa08f93387737f79753299f5", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そんなに……？", "zh": "诶！？有、有那么夸张吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0485af01cd82c5b1e98c49bfba154a97fd6e4f38120942d17f1111b1c489de9e", "ja": "ああ！　ステージに上がったら、みんなの視線が\nのり子に釘付けになるくらい、とても綺麗で……。", "zh": "啊！等你登上舞台后，会美得让大家的目光都牢牢锁定在你身上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "49c6afe20845cf789ab1ecb0db4c166955f9c4f7ac3bef76c009fa1f573ca89d", "ja": "あわわっ……ストップ、ストップ～！！", "zh": "哇哇……暂停，快暂停～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "de606d34d1d83f929b406a7a66d9bb511c6eb6eb63a53e30cc3bdf4cf889f22b", "ja": "{$P$}、ホント褒めすぎっ！\n感想はよくわかったから。これ以上は大丈夫。", "zh": "{$P$}，真的夸过头啦！\n你的感想我已经充分了解了。再说下去就不用啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1014_p", "source_sha256": "41e396d877ca4fdc9f25ebeb663ff93f83bd2cb6bafd62089cc7529bbf058e68", "ja": "そうか……？　まだまだ言い足りないけど。", "zh": "是吗……？可我还觉得没夸够呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "36bcf5fb5f2c373485906e1ece1156d114e10da3a96b65c63b5cb21c6b486be0", "ja": "いいから！　もうカンベンして！", "zh": "行了行了！快饶了我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "8ec5a7629fd0f312dd2d0d33a3707cff95517f9adfd1c6fff7a323160c847c8f", "ja": "今回、みんなに「カワイイ」っていっぱい言って\nもらったからさ。免疫ついたかと思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "这次大家对我说了好多“可爱”，我还以为自己已经免疫了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "5f731f10967ef8890279cab135f9c805de8805b925d5ea0ca840f3575d5bafec", "ja": "やっぱダメだ～、照れる！\nはあ～……顔がめちゃくちゃ熱くて大変だよ……。", "zh": "还是不行啊～，好害羞！\n唉～……脸热得不得了，真难受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f0c5ffd7511551abfed48ed0104674931512007f5b9eb64326ad48d93e2772bd", "ja": "はは、ごめんごめん。\nいきなりペースを上げ過ぎたみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，抱歉抱歉。\n好像一下子把进度提得太快了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "bef0b4d104a6b61abbaa9974851cf53bde87de469a53e1e01411cded2d3b7524", "ja": "ホントだよ！　アタシだけからかわれてるみたいで\n不公平だし、{$P$}も褒めてあげる！", "zh": "真的！感觉只有我被捉弄了，太不公平了，我也要夸夸{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1020_p", "source_sha256": "54002aa27a5730bb0f49851670fa878a9739457a7fe83c3fcd8c46efe0b99767", "ja": "えっ！？　俺はいいって！", "zh": "诶！？我就不用了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "0008413dc520372e8913a43ffd5ce1d23cd59b716e4f9930efbf9f0c9f250ef1", "ja": "もう、遠慮しないで！　{$P$}って\nいつもアイドルのために頑張ってるでしょ？", "zh": "哎呀，别客气啦！{$P$}你\n不是一直都在为了偶像努力嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "a4ba78bbfad101db04ce096d85d8f9542ddf9efab4171b9ba710b020beadef57", "ja": "そういう一途なとこ、尊敬してるんだ。アタシも\n自分の好きなことには正直になりたいな。それと……。", "zh": "我很尊敬你那份专一。我要是也能对自己喜欢的事情坦率一点就好了。还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0494_1023_p", "source_sha256": "db10f0f606d121bbb7869f7ac1b081b473fc765ff263fcf8e5f432f1556ed311", "ja": "（その後も、のり子の褒め殺し攻撃は続いた……。\nからかってたわけじゃないんだけど……）", "zh": "（之后，典子的夸奖轰炸还在继续……我也不是在逗她啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
